xchk-registry integration: Apache-2.0, copyright (c) 2026 Sean MacGuire.

examples/01-trust-record.json: a Trust Record minted and signed by the registry at https://in.xchk.io for plate
ENG-WNP3, run 3057 (18 October 2026), cut to one approval-outcome reference. examples/expected.json pins the
registry's seal key, as published at https://in.xchk.io/.well-known/xchk-keys.json, so the test runs offline. The
record carries the plate owner's identifiers; he chose to publish it.

examples/approval-outcome/: eight Trust Records and seven receipt bundles minted and signed by the registry at
https://in.xchk.io for plate ENG-WNP3, run 3057 (17 October 2026), with expected.json as the registry's own record
of each case; the altered copies (02, 06, 08) were made by the registry's fixture generator. They carry the plate
owner's identifiers; he chose to publish them.

verify_receipt.py: the xChk registry's offline receipt verifier, copyright (c) 2026 Sean MacGuire, MIT License
(the notice in the file's header), vendored for the fixtures' tests as the registry serves it at
https://in.xchk.io/verify/verify_receipt.py. Not part of the agentrust-trace package.
